{"info":{"name":"BMA-84 이용권 구매/구독 결제 API (CM-13~17)","description":"BMA-84 이용권 구매/구독 결제 API 검증 컬렉션 (공통컴포넌트 사양서 v1.7 CM-13~17).\n\n스텁 게이트웨이(PAYMENT_GATEWAY=stub) 기준. 상품 목록 → 일일 무료 매칭 기회 3회 소진 → 소모형 결제(결제창 승인·멱등·타인 주문·실패) → 이용권으로 대기열 진입 → 구독 등록(카드 거부/성공)·즉시 지급 → 저장 카드 청구 → 재매칭권 사용(매칭 종료·즉시 대기열) → 청구 배치(이월 누적·상한 소멸·멱등) → 해지·만료 → 웹훅 순서로 검증한다.\nRunner 로 위에서부터 순서대로 실행해야 한다.\n\n사전 조건\n- docker compose up -d --build\n- 46~51, 55 (관리자 배치)는 adminToken 변수에 ROLE_ADMIN 사용자의 액세스 토큰을 넣어야 한다. 예) UPDATE US_USER SET USER_ROLE=\"ADMIN\" WHERE EMAIL=... 후 재로그인. 비워 두면 해당 요청만 401/403 로 실패한다.\n\n토스 샌드박스 실연동은 backend/scripts/verify-payment-toss.sh 참고.","schema":"https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"},"item":[{"name":"1. 사용자 A 회원가입","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// 매 실행마다 새 계정·닉네임·주문 ID 를 쓴다. 반복 실행해도 깨지지 않게 한다.","const t = Date.now();","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailA\", \"pay-a-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailB\", \"pay-b-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nickA\", \"결제A\" + (t % 100000));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nickB\", \"결제B\" + (t % 100000));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"orderId1\", \"ord-a-\" + t);","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"paymentKey1\", \"pk-\" + t);"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userA\", pm.response.json().data.userId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"2. 로그인 A","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenA\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"3. 프로필 A (매칭 가능 상태)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"nickname\":\"{{nickA}}\",\"birthDate\":\"1995-05-05\",\"genderCode\":\"M\",\"regionCode\":\"SEOUL_GANGNAM\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/profile","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","profile"]}}},{"name":"4. 상품 목록 (CM-14/15/16)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"소모형 2 + 구독 1, 가격·월 지급 구성\", () => { pm.expect(d).to.have.lengthOf(3); const sub = d.find(p => p.productCode === \"PREMIUM_MONTHLY\"); pm.expect(sub.productType).to.eql(\"SUBSCRIPTION\"); pm.expect(Number(sub.price)).to.eql(9900); pm.expect(sub.benefit.monthlyGrants).to.eql({ MATCH_CHANCE: 3, REMATCH_TICKET: 2 }); pm.expect(sub.benefit.carryOverMonths).to.eql(2); pm.expect(d.filter(p => p.productType === \"ITEM\")).to.have.lengthOf(2); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/products","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","payments","products"]}}},{"name":"5. 내 이용권 현황 - 초기값","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","const bal = (t) => d.items.find(i => i.itemType === t);","pm.test(\"잔여 0, 무료 기회 3/0/3, 구독 없음\", () => { pm.expect(bal(\"MATCH_CHANCE\").total).to.eql(0); pm.expect(bal(\"REMATCH_TICKET\").total).to.eql(0); pm.expect(d.freeChancesToday).to.eql({ limit: 3, used: 0, remaining: 3 }); pm.expect(d.subscribed).to.eql(false); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/me/items","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","payments","me","items"]}}},{"name":"6. 대기열 진입 1 (FREE)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"entrySource=FREE\", () => pm.expect(d.entrySource).to.eql(\"FREE\"));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"queueId1\", d.queueId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/queue","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","queue"]}}},{"name":"7. 대기 중 재진입 → 같은 항목(무소모)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"같은 queueId\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.queueId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"queueId1\")));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/queue","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","queue"]}}},{"name":"8. 대기열 취소","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"DELETE","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/queue","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","queue"]}}},{"name":"9. 대기열 진입 2 (FREE)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"FREE\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.entrySource).to.eql(\"FREE\"));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/queue","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","queue"]}}},{"name":"10. 대기열 취소","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"DELETE","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/queue","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","queue"]}}},{"name":"11. 대기열 진입 3 (FREE)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"FREE\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.entrySource).to.eql(\"FREE\"));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/queue","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","queue"]}}},{"name":"12. 대기열 취소","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"DELETE","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/queue","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","queue"]}}},{"name":"13. 무료 기회 소진 확인","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"used=3 remaining=0\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.freeChancesToday).to.eql({ limit: 3, used: 3, remaining: 0 }));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/me/items","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","payments","me","items"]}}},{"name":"14. 4번째 진입 → 409 PAY_006 (구매 모달 소모형 탭)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 409 PAY_006\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(409); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"PAY_006\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/queue","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","queue"]}}},{"name":"15. 소모형 결제 - 결제창 승인 (CM-15)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"DONE WIDGET 1000, MATCH_CHANCE purchased=1\", () => { pm.expect(d.payment.status).to.eql(\"DONE\"); pm.expect(d.payment.payMethod).to.eql(\"WIDGET\"); pm.expect(Number(d.payment.amount)).to.eql(1000); const b = d.items.find(i => i.itemType === \"MATCH_CHANCE\"); pm.expect(b.purchased).to.eql(1); pm.expect(b.total).to.eql(1); });","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"paymentId1\", d.payment.paymentId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"productCode\":\"MATCH_CHANCE\",\"orderId\":\"{{orderId1}}\",\"paymentKey\":\"{{paymentKey1}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/consumable","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","payments","consumable"]}}},{"name":"16. 같은 orderId 재요청 → 멱등","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"같은 paymentId, 중복 지급 없음\", () => { pm.expect(d.payment.paymentId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"paymentId1\")); pm.expect(d.items.find(i => i.itemType === \"MATCH_CHANCE\").total).to.eql(1); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"productCode\":\"MATCH_CHANCE\",\"orderId\":\"{{orderId1}}\",\"paymentKey\":\"{{paymentKey1}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/consumable","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","payments","consumable"]}}},{"name":"17. 사용자 B 회원가입","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userB\", pm.response.json().data.userId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailB}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"18. 로그인 B","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenB\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailB}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"19. B 가 A 의 orderId 로 결제 → 404 PAY_005","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 404 PAY_005\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(404); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"PAY_005\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"productCode\":\"MATCH_CHANCE\",\"orderId\":\"{{orderId1}}\",\"paymentKey\":\"{{paymentKey1}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/consumable","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","payments","consumable"]}}},{"name":"20. 결제창 승인 실패 (스텁: fail- 키) → 400 PAY_002","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 400 PAY_002\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(400); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"PAY_002\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"productCode\":\"REMATCH_TICKET\",\"orderId\":\"ord-fail-{{$timestamp}}\",\"paymentKey\":\"fail-{{$timestamp}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/consumable","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","payments","consumable"]}}},{"name":"21. 결제 내역 - 최신 건 FAILED","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"FAILED\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data[0].status).to.eql(\"FAILED\"));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/me","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","payments","me"]}}},{"name":"22. 무료 소진 상태 진입 → ITEM (이용권 소모)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"entrySource=ITEM\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.entrySource).to.eql(\"ITEM\"));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/queue","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","queue"]}}},{"name":"23. 이용권 잔여 0","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"MATCH_CHANCE total=0\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.items.find(i => i.itemType === \"MATCH_CHANCE\").total).to.eql(0));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/me/items","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","payments","me","items"]}}},{"name":"24. 대기열 취소","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"DELETE","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/queue","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","queue"]}}},{"name":"25. 진입 → 다시 409 PAY_006","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 409 PAY_006\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(409); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"PAY_006\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/queue","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","queue"]}}},{"name":"26. 저장 카드 없이 소모형 청구 → 409 PAY_008","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 409 PAY_008\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(409); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"PAY_008